Rights and provenance statement
================================

This repository archives student academic/research work originally produced
in 2018 for the 5th International Conference "Information Technology and
Interactions" (ITI&I-2018), Taras Shevchenko National University of Kyiv.

© 2018 М. М. Антоневич (M. M. Antonevych), В. І. Кудін (V. I. Kudin),
А. М. Онищенко (A. M. Onyshchenko).

The original 2018 materials (thesis text, presentation, source code drafts,
photos) had no explicit license attached at the time of creation, as is
typical for student coursework. They are archived here, in 2026, for
portfolio and reference purposes by one of the original authors
(М. М. Антоневич), with provenance documented in `docs/provenance.md`.

